{"id":"booth","name":"Booth","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:booth"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Booth","text":"A hut made of the branches of a tree. In such tabernacles Jacob sojourned for a season at a place named from this circumstance Succoth (Gen. 33:17). Booths were erected also at the feast of Tabernacles (q.v.), Lev. 23:42, 43, which commemorated the abode of the Israelites in the wilderness."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H5521","lemma":"סֻכָּה","xlit":"çukkâh","gloss":"a hut or lair","kjv":"booth, cottage, covert, pavilion","count":8,"share":0.73},{"strong":"H4412","lemma":"מְלוּנָה","xlit":"mᵉlûwnâh","gloss":"a hut, a hammock","kjv":"cottage, lodge","count":2,"share":0.18},{"strong":"H5687","lemma":"עָבֹת","xlit":"ʻâbôth","gloss":"intwined","kjv":"thick","count":2,"share":0.18},{"strong":"H8558","lemma":"תָּמָר","xlit":"tâmâr","gloss":"a palm tree","kjv":"palm","count":2,"share":0.18},{"strong":"H7651","lemma":"שֶׁבַע","xlit":"shebaʻ","gloss":"seven","kjv":"seven, -s, -th, times)","count":3,"share":0.27},{"strong":"H5341","lemma":"נָצַר","xlit":"nâtsar","gloss":"to guard, in a good sense or a bad one","kjv":"besieged, hidden thing, keep, monument","count":2,"share":0.18}],"verses":["Gen.33.17","Lev.23.42","Lev.23.43","Neh.8.15","Neh.8.16","Job.27.18","Isa.1.8","Jonah.4.5","Lev.23.40","Lev.23.41","Isa.24.20"],"related":[{"id":"tabernacles-feast-of","type":"cooccur","shared":6,"jaccard":0.171,"why":"6 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"ethanim","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.125,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"feast-of-tabernacles","type":"cooccur","shared":6,"jaccard":0.085,"why":"6 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"seven","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.022,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"tabernacles-feast-of","type":"lexical","strong":"H5521","why":"both lead with סֻכָּה (H5521)"}],"works":[{"work":"npnf101","title":"Nicene and Post-Nicene Fathers, Series 1